{"id":"486528342e0c392b","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-uncomputable-diagonal-language.md","title":"不可判定的对角语言","display":"thm-uncomputable-diagonal-language — 不可判定的对角语言","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-uncomputable-diagonal-language","aliases":["28-thm-uncomputable-diagonal-language"],"display":"thm-uncomputable-diagonal-language — 不可判定的对角语言","depends_on":["[[28-df-tm]]","[[28-df-computation]]","[[28-df-godel-numbering]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; Theorem 1.10 and proof","source_printed_pages":"22","source_pdf_pages":"48","source_status":"statement-compared-local-proof-reviewed","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"local_proof_reviewed":true,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-uncomputable-diagonal-language"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-uncomputable-diagonal-language</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-uncomputable-diagonal-language — 不可判定的对角语言"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1965e2b0765554c9\" href=\"?note=1965e2b0765554c9\" title=\"28-df-tm\">28-df-tm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"256220eba4eba968\" href=\"?note=256220eba4eba968\" title=\"28-df-computation\">28-df-computation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b54d75aae768415e\" href=\"?note=b54d75aae768415e\" title=\"28-df-godel-numbering\">28-df-godel-numbering</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; Theorem 1.10 and proof"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"22"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"48"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-proof-reviewed"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"local_proof_reviewed","html":"true"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ser}_{\\mathrm{TM}}\">\\(\\operatorname{ser}_{\\mathrm{TM}}\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b54d75aae768415e\" href=\"?note=b54d75aae768415e\" title=\"28-df-godel-numbering\">28-df-godel-numbering</a> 固定的可计算、可判定值域机器序列化；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M_0\\in\\mathrm{TM}\">\\(M_0\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\)</span> 为恒拒绝机。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(M)\">\\(L(M)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"256220eba4eba968\" href=\"?note=256220eba4eba968\" title=\"28-df-computation\">28-df-computation</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M_\\alpha\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\operatorname{ser}_{\\mathrm{TM}}^{-1}(\\alpha)&amp;\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\operatorname{ser}_{\\mathrm{TM}}),\\\\M_0&amp;\\alpha\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(\\operatorname{ser}_{\\mathrm{TM}}).\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M_\\alpha\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\operatorname{ser}_{\\mathrm{TM}}^{-1}(\\alpha)&amp;\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\operatorname{ser}_{\\mathrm{TM}}),\\\\M_0&amp;\\alpha\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(\\operatorname{ser}_{\\mathrm{TM}}).\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"D\\coloneqq\\{\\alpha\\in\\Sigma^*: \\alpha\\notin L(M_\\alpha)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[D\\coloneqq\\{\\alpha\\in\\Sigma^*: \\alpha\\notin L(M_\\alpha)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;L(M)=D.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;L(M)=D.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若L(M)=D，取α=ser_TM(M)，则α∈D等价于α∉L(M)，又等价于α∉D，矛盾。这实际还证明D没有半判定器，强于无总判定器。原书UC按“输出1”翻转；本目录机器以接受状态判定语言，故用接受语义逐项对应，未混用工作带输出。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Theorem 1.10 and proof；印刷 pp.22 / PDF pp.48。本次核对范围：原书对应陈述及本注内所列论证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-tm","status":"resolved","id":"1965e2b0765554c9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-tm]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-computation","status":"resolved","id":"256220eba4eba968","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-computation]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"b54d75aae768415e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"b54d75aae768415e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$\\operatorname{ser}_{\\mathrm{TM}}$ 是 [[28-df-godel-numbering]] 固定的可计算、可判定值域机器序列化；$M_0\\in\\mathrm{TM}$ 为恒拒绝机。$L(M)$ 见 [[28-df-computation]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-computation","status":"resolved","id":"256220eba4eba968","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$\\operatorname{ser}_{\\mathrm{TM}}$ 是 [[28-df-godel-numbering]] 固定的可计算、可判定值域机器序列化；$M_0\\in\\mathrm{TM}$ 为恒拒绝机。$L(M)$ 见 [[28-df-computation]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ser}_{\\mathrm{TM}}","display":false},{"tex":"M_0\\in\\mathrm{TM}","display":false},{"tex":"L(M)","display":false},{"tex":"M_\\alpha\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\operatorname{ser}_{\\mathrm{TM}}^{-1}(\\alpha)&\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\operatorname{ser}_{\\mathrm{TM}}),\\\\M_0&\\alpha\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(\\operatorname{ser}_{\\mathrm{TM}}).\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"D\\coloneqq\\{\\alpha\\in\\Sigma^*: \\alpha\\notin L(M_\\alpha)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\neg\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;L(M)=D.","display":true}],"bytes":1812,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-273","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-ex-palindrome-linear-time]]、[[28-thm-binary-alphabet-simulation]]、[[28-thm-uncomputable-diagonal-language]]、[[28-df-halting-language]]、[[28-thm-halting-undecidability]]。"}],"outgoing":["1965e2b0765554c9","256220eba4eba968","b54d75aae768415e"]}